Component Plan

Webpage the component will be applied to: Gallery
Type of component: Rating System
Why it's needed: The users will have a way to rate all of the photos and give feedback, further than just stating their favorite on my form on the home page
Features: It will feature 5 selectable stars, and I am working on the color/size transitions when the cursor hovers or selects the stars. 
What you'll use to build it: Flexbox
